Package: pladdrr
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Access to Praat Algorithms via Rcpp Modules
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-12-17
Authors@R: c(
    person("Fredrik", "Nylén", email = "dargosch@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides efficient access to Praat speech analysis algorithms by
    directly exposing C++ classes through Rcpp modules. This approach minimizes
    overhead compared to traditional R6 class wrappers and achieves performance
    comparable to the Python parselmouth package.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0),
    methods
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++11
RoxygenNote: 7.0.0
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/humlab-speech/pladdrr
BugReports: https://github.com/humlab-speech/pladdrr/issues
